<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Surface Texture</TTL><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>The surface texture of each lot will be visually examined by a representative of the Contractor's Quality 
Control immediately after construction to determine compliance with the surface texture requirements 
in paragraph RCC PAVEMENT PERFORMANCE REQUIREMENTS.  The classification of the surface texture of any 
area of the pavement as acceptable or deficient will be made on the basis of comparison with a selected 
portion of the test section which has been chosen and marked as having an acceptable surface texture 
as determined by the Contracting Officer.  The computed percent payment for surface texture requirements 
for the lot will be determined as shown in Table 3.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Regardless of payment, removed and replaced full depth with suitable pavement at no cost to the Government 
any area of any size of extremely poor surface texture as determined by the Contracting Officer. No payment 
calculations will be made until all such defective material is removed and replaced.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/>
